# graphify scan-exclusion list (gitignore semantics, scan-root relative).
# Merged with .gitignore by graphify. Keeps secrets + vendor/build noise out of
# the knowledge-graph corpus — and, for the LLM path, out of what is sent to the
# backend (graphify reads file CONTENT before any commit). The real control is
# WHICH directory you scan: never point graphify at secret material.

# Secrets / credentials
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/secrets/**
*.pem
*.key
*_rsa
*_ed25519

# graphify's own output (never treat the graph as input)
graphify-out/

# Vendor / build noise
node_modules/
.venv/
.direnv/
target/
dist/
build/
result
result-*
